  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEF GOLD+ Mali: Enhancing the formalization and mercury reduction in artisanal and small scale gold mining (ASGM) in Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child project part of the amendment of then GOLD+ programme on artisanal gold mining under the leadership of Conservation International and with funding from the GEF. The project was developed at the request of the GEF OFP that followed discussions with the UNIDO Field Office in February 2020.</narrative>
